---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base lang="zh" title="404 · 这一页不存在">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 pt-20 text-center">
    <div class="font-mono text-7xl font-bold">404</div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink2">这一页搬走了，或者从来没有存在过。</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-muted">This page has moved, or never existed.</p>
    <p class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="rounded-md bg-primary px-5 py-2.5 font-semibold text-onprimary">回首页</a>
      <a href="/search" class="rounded-md border border-linestrong px-5 py-2.5">去搜索</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
